Program.cs (Blazor Web App, Interactive Server):

```csharp
builder.Services.AddSingleton<VisitCounter>();
```

```csharp
public class VisitCounter
{
    public int Count { get; set; }
}
```

Counter.razor:

```razor
@page "/counter"
@rendermode InteractiveServer
@inject VisitCounter Counter

<p>Clicks: @Counter.Count</p>
<button @onclick="() => Counter.Count++">+1</button>
```

Ana opens `/counter` on her laptop and clicks **+1** three times. Then Bo opens `/counter` on his phone.

**What does Bo see?**

